
# 200KB+ copies of the ledger and have no history value in the tree.
# CI installs with `npm ci`). bun may still be used locally, but its lockfile
# Pre-release changelog snapshots (§10.4 step 3). Never committed: they are
# Single-lockfile authority: package-lock.json is the SSOT (AGENTS.md §1, and
# must not be committed — two lockfiles for one dependency set drift silently.
*.log
.codey/checkpoint.json
.codey/lock
.vercel
CHANGELOG.md.bak-*
bun.lock
dist/
isolate/
node_modules/
playwright-report/
test-results/
